From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: filipi87 <filipi87@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:37:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] daily-audio-mode: setDailyAudioMode and iOS background
 keep-alive

setDailyAudioMode(video|voice|idle) configures audio focus/route (Android
DailyAudioManager) or the AVAudioSession category/mode (iOS). Choosing a device
with setAudioDevice switches to the user-specified route. iOS also gets
enableNoOpRecordingEnsuringBackgroundContinuity.
